      "id": "cm08-symmetry-noether-and-conditional-conservation",
      "location": "Page summary, paragraph on pthm-cm08-translation",
      "defect": "false-claim",
      "evidence": "The summary equates “the invariance of U under the simultaneous translation of all labels” with the differential condition sum_i a·∇_{x_i}U=0 without specifying admissible translation arcs. The scoped theorem pthm-cm08-translation limits the finite-invariance equivalence to segments contained in Q and says invariance across separated components additionally requires their constants to agree; its Remark gives a smooth potential equal to 0 and 1 on separate balls with zero directional derivative but no invariance between those components. Thus the summary's unqualified equivalence is false for general open Q.",
      "severity": "fatal",
