      "evidence": "Step 2.1 says [F3] applies to establish hyperregularity on the fibre-full domain. But prop-cm-mechanical-chart-lagrangian-is-hyperregular states its fields on a product base J×U, whereas the Statement allows an arbitrary open Ω⊂R×R^{3N}, which need not be a product. The result can be recovered by restricting to product neighborhoods or using the displayed positive-definite kinetic matrix and its explicit inverse, but that localization is not given.",
